

These are Macros related to the HehJay II vehicle controller which links the steering and acceleration/deceleration needs of the driver to thru USB/CAN to the physical movement of vehicle components.  The vehicle controller also 
provides the driver with vehicle status such as speed and battery capacity. 

As of the Project Deferral date, June 30, 2025, the Vehicle controller was functional but had not been linked to 
the HehJay II suspension, acceleration, breaking, or battery management for simulation or physical movement. As resources become available physical models will be employed to verify design behavior.

The Project deferral prevented creation of specific FreeCAD Tools-Macro for usage within the gm_vehicle workbench.  As such to use one of these Macro they must be installed in the user's FreeCAD.Macros folder and accessed a FreeCAD instance from the Toolbar.Macro panel.
